# Rust edits

- Mutations live in `crates/engine`; schemas and validation bounds stay strict.
- Golden fixtures under `crates/<crate>/tests/fixtures/` for readers/writers.
- Unit test names as sentences: `rejects_out_of_range`, not `test_foo`.
- Before push: prefer fork CI; optional local `cargo xtask test -p <crate>` for tight loops.
- Layer check is in CI: `cargo xtask policy` (see `docs/ci.md`).
